</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">We’re delighted to announce that Flywire has been accepted into <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="http://www.virtuoso.com/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=insurance_newsletter"><strong><u>Virtuoso</u></strong></a></span>®’s exclusive portfolio of luxury travel partners, comprising 2,300 preferred suppliers in 100 countries.</p> </td> 
