</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><em>"It’s a real honor to have been accepted as a Virtuoso Preferred Partner. It gives Virtuoso members confidence that Flywire will provide the same dedication and excellence they provide for their clients. Using Flywire, Virtuoso members can offer more convenient, secure and streamlined payments, driving efficiency, improving conversion, and, critically, delivering an improved client experience to help drive loyalty.”</em></p> </td> 
