</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 27px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 29px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 27px; line-height: 29px;">Payment Requests:</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We’ve extended our same currency pre-auth and capture window to allow extension in seven day increments.. Clients can extend manually from the dashboard up to 7 days or via API. This enables auth and capture for longer or outdated trips and helps avoid any refunds.</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Clients can now set custom payment request reminders based on the due date for payment requests. This can be turned on within Payment Request settings.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-618-150" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/9pbfsien6v/en_us/images/68754faf651fc-1752518575.4142.png" alt="Payment Requests" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>For clients who want to allow payers to add gratuity in addition to the amount owed, they can now offer payers the option to add gratuity on top of the payment request amount. This is a feature flag that can be turned on by reaching out to <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="mailto:travel_operations@flywire.com"><strong><u>travel_operations@flywire.com</u></strong></a></span></li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-618-150" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/9pbfsien6v/en_us/images/687550fa62f5d-1752518906.4053.png" alt="Payment Requests" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>For payers looking to split the cost of a trip between multiple parties or multiple payment methods, clients can now use template links to support partial payment. Please reach out to <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="mailto:travel_operations@flywire.com"><strong><u>travel_operations@flywire.com</u></strong></a></span> for more information.</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Coming at the end of the month, clients can generate a real-time quote for the amount their payer will pay in their local currency for the chosen payment method within the Payment Request flow. Now this quote can be held for 7 days, allowing payers to know the exact amount they’d pay through Flywire and reduce concerns around rate fluctuation.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
