<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Virtuoso Travel Week - August 10-16</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Travel Trade Maldives - August 27-28</span></li> 
